          "text": "<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #4c7d7a;\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Four channels. Fast ablation.<sup><a href=\"#references\">1</a></sup></span></span></span></span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">The OptaBlate BVN system provides four channels for fast, simultaneous ablations—at least 1cm ablation in seven minutes.<sup><a href=\"#references\">1</a></sup></span></p>\n",
